            Tvoje současné kolo
          </h2>
          <p
            class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed"
          >
            Zadej, co má tvoje kolo dnes, abychom to porovnali s cílovými hodnotami.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-slate-50/60 space-y-5"
        >
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900"
            >
              Tvoje současné kolo
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Zadej, co má tvoje kolo dnes. Porovnáme to s cíli ze znalostní báze a uložíme to do tvého profilu.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="space-y-3"
          >
            <label
              class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 block"
            >
              Délka klik na tvém současném kole (mm)
            </label>
            <div
              class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-2"
            >
              <button
                class="py-2 px-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all text-center bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 border-slate-200"
                type="button"
              >
                150mm
              </button>
              <button
                class="py-2 px-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all text-center bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 border-slate-200"
                type="button"
              >
                160mm
              </button>
              <button
                class="py-2 px-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all text-center bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 border-slate-200"
                type="button"
              >
                165mm
              </button>
              <button
                class="py-2 px-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all text-center bg-blue-600 text-white border-blue-600 shadow-sm"
                type="button"
              >
                170mm
              </button>
              <button
                class="py-2 px-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all text-center bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 border-slate-200"
                type="button"
              >
                172.5mm
              </button>
              <button
                class="py-2 px-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border transition-all text-center bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 border-slate-200"
                type="button"
              >
                175mm
              </button>
            </div>
            <div
              class="pt-2"
            >
              <button
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:underline transition-colors py-1 focus:outline-none text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700"
                data-testid="crank-guide-trigger"
                type="button"
              >
                <span>
                  Kde najdu délku svých klik?
                </span>
                <span
                  class="font-mono text-xs text-blue-500"
                >
                  ↗
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="space-y-2"
          >
            <div
              class="flex justify-between items-center"
            >
              <label
                class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-slate-700"
                for="wizard-saddle-slider"
              >
                Současná výška sedla od středu středového složení (mm)
              </label>
              <span
                class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-blue-600"
              >
                nezadáno
              </span>
            </div>
            <input
              class="w-full bg-slate-200 h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer accent-blue-600"
              id="wizard-saddle-slider"
              max="900"
              min="600"
              step="1"
